window.products.push({"id":587270,"name":"What Can Red Wigglers Eat? 13x19 Infographic Poster for Live Red Wiggler Worm Composting Bins - an Essential Accessory to Any Worm Farm Starter Kit - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91R4Ksl7vQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Imagine this:You've just finished another delicious breakfast and you lean back in your chair. As you look down at your plate, a puzzled expression creeps across your face. You are too tired to remember whether or not it is okay to feed the scraps from your omelette to your worms.You want to feed your worms a healthy, nutritious diet, but you don't have time to check online to see if an omelette would fit the bill. You have to get to work, after all!This is where the \"What Can Red Wigglers Eat?\" Infographic Poster comes in to save the day! It is a fast and easy way to learn that your worms would love the veggies from your omelette, but eggs are a no-go in a worm bin.This brightly colored 13\" x 19\" poster breaks common food items down into three categories: perfect worm foods, foods to feed in moderation, and foods to avoid feeding altogether. Each category has its own section on the poster, complete with easy to understand images for each food item that show you exactly which foods will be healthy for your worms to eat.This poster truly helps to make worm composting feel like second nature. Imagine the peace of mind you will feel knowing that your worms are always eating a healthy diet. You will never be confused about feeding your worms again, and you can rest assured that your worms will thrive!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91R4Ksl7vQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dkocva","source_asin":"B01N0BIK02","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-587270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N0BIK02","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N0BIK02","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
