window.products.push({"id":587389,"name":"VONVOFF Cup Hook,1.73 Inches Ceiling Hooks,Kitchen Hooks,Metal Screw Hooks for Hanging Plants,Multi-Function Wall Hooks,Great for Indoor & Outdoor Use","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EgML75h4L._AC_.jpg","description":"Problems you may have encountered: Q: It broke when I screwed it into the wood. A: If the wood and plastic are too hard, please turn a small hole in advance (1-2mm in diameter). Q: My cup doesn't hang in, the nail is too small. A: The opening size of the nail is 0.5in. Consider whether it is suitable before purchase. Q: Can nails hang heavy objects? Such as chopping board, wok and so on. A: Yes. Q: Will it rust after prolonged use? A: The surface of the hook is gold-plated or painted to prevent rust. Q: I received less than 30PCS. A: This is my mistake, let me know, I will send it to you extra. If you have any questions,You can contact us,We will try our best to help you solve the problem. Thank you. Warm Tip: * This hanging hook contains functional sharp points. Please put it out of children's and baby's reach.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EgML75h4L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"donjon","source_asin":"B07MBMTGTL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-587389","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MBMTGTL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MBMTGTL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
