window.products.push({"id":587442,"name":"Martini Cocktail Shaker Muddler Kit Stainless Steel Barware Set, 20 ounces Designer Hammered Steel by Modern Mixology","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LdDk2IgiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Impress your friends with hand crafted cocktails. It's a snap with the easy to follow recipes that are included. A cocktail shaker is a container used to mix beverages (most often alcoholic) by shaking. For a quicker cooling of the drink before serving add ice while shaking. Then pour the cocktail out through the strainer so that the ice will not water down your drink. We prefer this type of shaker to the Boston Cocktail Shaker which uses a stainless steel bottom and a glass on the top. The Boston Cocktail Shaker is more for the pro. To make your shaken masterpiece add desired ingredients (typically fruit juices, syrups and liqueurs) in the martini shaker. Then shake vigorously for around 5 to 10 seconds, be sure to hold the lid on while doing so. Two hands are usually needed unless you are a pro. This is a three-piece cocktail shaker that has tapers at the top and ends with a built-in strainer and includes a cap. The cap can often be used as a measure for spirits. LOVE the bonus Mojito Muddler. Egyptians as long ago as 3500 BCE were adding spices to their fermented grain concoctions before serving, to make them more palatable. By the late 19th century, the cocktail shaker as we now know it was in wide use. The martini shaker set was invented by an innkeeper who, while using two containers to pour Now you can entertain and impress your party guests with your craft cocktail skills. Shakers come in all types of styles. We have even seen a Plane Cocktail Shaker. (shaped like a plane) Bonus: Free Cocktail Muddler and drink recipes include. We've included some classic and specialty cocktails for Rum, Vodka and Gin drinks. Feel free to substitute whatever.. A must have classic for your bar How to care for your new Martini Shaker Set and Muddler Bar Tool: while they are dishwasher safe we recommend that you simply wash and dry by hand. This will keep them shiny and without water spots. Cheers!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LdDk2IgiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modern Mixology","source_asin":"B00W6J1YAS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-587442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00W6J1YAS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00W6J1YAS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
