window.products.push({"id":587482,"name":"Oven Mitts and Potholders, Blue Dragons Baking Glove and Pot Holder for Cooking BBQ, 3-Piece Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E4j5SkYIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Oven Gloves Size: 13.8x19.8 Inches Insulation Square Pad Size: 8.78x8.78 Inches To Meet Your Needs. Heat Resistant Oven Mitts And Potholders Are Heat Resistant Up To Degrees And Provides Added Protection To Your Hands To Help You Safely Handle Hot Kitchenware Items Coming Out Of The Oven Or Microwave.It Can Effectively Prevent You From Being Scalded When Cooking,Baking Or Grilling. Premium Material Water-Proof Polyester Fabric + Heat-Insulating Fabric, Heat-Insulating Gloves Use High-Quality Fabrics, Fine Workmanship, Thick And Durable, Anti-Scalding And Heat Insulation. The Inner And Outer Layers Are Made Of Waterproof Fabric, Which Is Easier To Clean.The Side Lanyard Design Is Convenient For Hanging And Storing. Multi-Purpose Use To Hold Hot Pots, Pans, Plates, Bowls And Trays, And Also Place Any Hot Item Straight From The Stove Top, Microwave Or Oven Onto The Pot Holder. Make The Most Of Your Imagination Using It.If You Are Removing A Baked Pizza Or Cast Iron Skillet From The Oven, A Pan/Pot From The Stove Top, A Bowl Of Soup From The Microwave, Items From The Grill, These Hot Pads And Oven Mitts Are A Must. For Outdoor Use Our Oven Mitts Offer Protection Up To Degrees. So They Will Also Spare Tender Hands And Forearms From Burns That Can Occur When Your Outdoor Grill Experiences A Flare-Up.You Can Use These Oven Mitts To Retrieve A Pie From Your Oven And Remove Pot Lids Without Painful Burns And Scalds. Perfect For You To Enjoy Your Cooking,Baking Time! Make A Great Gift Ideal For Christmas/Halloween/Thanksgiving/Birthday Gifts For Friends Or Family Members Who Need Oven Mitts, And The Best Choice For Baking Lovers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E4j5SkYIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BIBIBA","source_asin":"B08YT95L6B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-587482","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YT95L6B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YT95L6B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":587483,"name":"KitchenDance Disposable Colored Aluminum Half Size Steam Table Pans- Color Options (10 Count Pack, Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VMF8rwSZL._SL1200_.jpg","description":"Nothing beats disposable steam table pans for convenience. Whether you are serving entrees and sides at parties or other functions, going straight from oven to serving table saves you time. And when the event is over, our disposable steam table pans make cleanup fast and easy, just dispose of them (better yet, recycle them.) Aluminum foil steam table pans are widely used by restaurants and caterers. Disposable Steam table come in three sizes: full, half, and third size steam table pans. Foil lids that snap on are available for all sizes, and a clear plastic lid is available for the half size. The full and half size pans are available in three depths: deep, medium, and shallow steam table pans. All of our steam table products are great multi-use pans and can be used for grilling, baking, BBQ's, marinating and holiday cooking. You can cook and freeze and reheat in these pans. Aluminum foil pans are recyclable. Our foil lids fit nicely and look good. They are great for keeping food covered and safe, and also when you want to freeze a larger quantity of food. Steam table pans are suitable for bulk foods - cooking & baking (casseroles), storage, display, and serving. Great for barbeques, pastries, and in the case of the third size, for baking large loaves of bread.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VMF8rwSZL._SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenDance.com","source_asin":"B07KYVR2SC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-587483","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KYVR2SC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KYVR2SC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
