window.products.push({"id":587492,"name":"The Ballow Ball Pillow - Round Pillow with Washable Boucle Pillow Covers -Sphere Pillow for Couch, Bed, or Chair - Circle Orb Shaped Decorative Throw ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tuiX3PLJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"IMPORTANT INFO TO KNOW For ease of shipping, The Ballow comes in a compressed vacuumed packed bag. You will need to fluff it well to get the ball shape. After a week or so, the filling will naturally expand to that perfect ball shape. :) The Ballow by Hooga HomeIt's the new must have decorative pillow. Even Gwyneth Paltrow has a ball pillow! Adding The Ballow ball pillow to your home decor is a playful, yet elegant way to break up the square angels of rectangular throw pillows. High Quality Materials Covered in everyone's new favorite fabric: boucle. Boucle is the more grown up version of sherpa or teddy fabric, and is most often seen on sofas. Our high quality boucle has low liquid absorption which makes it stain resistant. It's the perfect upholstery choice! We put extra stuffing in the ball pillow to make sure it holds it's shape. Not to worry, your cushion won't be too firm. It's bouncy and moldable for extra comfort. Easy To Clean Let's face it, if you use these as sofa pillows, a floor pillow, or in other high traffic living areas with kids playing, they're bound to get a little dirty. That's why we made the boucle throw pillow covers removable. Just throw it in the washing machine and hang to dry. A Style For Everyone A sphere pillow works well in any style room, from eclectic decor, retro vibes, modern decor, boho decor, and even traditional home decor. Kids and teenagers also love it! It’s Practical There's so many ways to use a round decorative pillow: chair pillow, couch pillow, bed decor, lumbar throw pillow. Also makes for a great pillow fight! Not too small or too big With a 10\" diameter, this round pillow is the perfect size. It doesn't overpower the seating room, like other throw pillows for couch. Our Colors Neutrals everyone loves! Ivory/white, blue, and grey. Thank you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tuiX3PLJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09PB3JVVK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-587492","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PB3JVVK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PB3JVVK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
