window.products.push({"id":587495,"name":"UC San Diego Tritons Logo Acrylic Christmas Tree Holiday Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516HA3PReEL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"HOLIDAY CHEER TO SHARE: Put your own spin on holiday traditions with our heirloom-quality ornaments. Available in a variety of themes and fandoms, these cheerful ornaments have a personal feel and make a versatile holiday decoration. DURABLE CONSTRUCTION: Crafted from high quality clear acrylic, our ornaments are printed on one side with the festive design shown. Unlike glass bulbs, our ornaments are shatterproof, making them perfect for families with kids or pets. Hanging cord included. Dimensions 3.0\" (7.6 cm) x 3.6\" (9.1 cm). FUN FOR KIDS, TEENS AND ADULTS: Suitable for all ages, these durable ornaments are great for accenting Christmas decorations, personalizing for loved ones, gift swaps, or just admiring. Perfect as holiday party favors, goodie bag fillers, team gifts, or anyone on your Nice list. OFFICIALLY LICENSED: University of California San Diego products sold by Graphics and More are guaranteed authentic, high quality and officially licensed. Proudly printed in the USA. A Graphics and More product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516HA3PReEL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GRAPHICS & MORE","source_asin":"B09CQG1Q82","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-587495","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CQG1Q82","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CQG1Q82","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":587496,"name":"Cloudz Memory Foam Travel Neck Pillow with Snap & Pocket - Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gId6hxGFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Clöudz Memory Foam Travel Neck Pillow was designed by our team of frequent flyers using our extensive knowledge about travel comfort, which comes from 15 years of specific experience. The first thing you will notice is the super soft and cozy plush cover, which is removable and washable. One squeeze of our pillow and you will immediately notice and surely appreciate the way our high density, ultra-premium “Comforlite” memory foam responds. It is easy and soft to squeeze, yet it will slowly return to its original shape. Therefore, when you use it, it will quickly conform to the specific characteristics of your neck, head and shoulders, and it will provide the perfect amount of support and help to relieve tension. The closed end “U” shape is designed to cradle your neck to provide additional support. Many other “memory foam” pillows with a similar look utilize inferior memory foam that is stiff and provides limited support. Their memory foam is stiff to the touch and will quickly return to the original shape. Yes, there IS a difference! Our pillow has our travelers’ favorite snap at the bottom allowing you to easily attach to your luggage or other carry bag for easy transport. The snap also allows you to snap closed while using the pillow to provide an additional “snug-fit” support level if desired. This will also help to prevent your head from falling forward while sleeping. Great for Plane, Car, Bus, Train or Home! Clöudz is the brand you can trust. We’ve been helping travelers around the world to have a more comfortable and positive travel experience for over 15 years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gId6hxGFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cloudz","source_asin":"B086LLJGJ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-587496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086LLJGJ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086LLJGJ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
