window.products.push({"id":587524,"name":"SmartDeal Bathroom Rugs Set, Extra Soft Chenille Bath Rugs Mat, Absorbent Plush Shaggy Bath Rugs, Machine Washable & Non Slip Bath Rugs for Bathroom, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91InSwCvoDS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[LUXURY 3 Pieces Turquoise Chenille Bath Rugs Set]1 Small Bath Rug 17\"x24\", 1 U-Shape Contoured Rug 22\"x24\", 1 Large Bath Rug 20\"x32\". Thicker and better constructed ensure no horrible fiber-dropping! Great gift idea for all occasions, Christmas, Wedding, Fathers Day, Mothers Day, Valentines, Birth Day & Etc.. [ULTRA PLUSH SHAG] Our bath mat features a luxurious, soft pile that soothes tired feet and shields toes from the cold floor. The density of our pile surpasses that of most other brands. each microfiber pile is about 1\" long, making your feet surrounded by thousands of individual microfiber shags. [HIGH WATER ABSORBENCY and Anti-slip] 1 inch High-pile, thick Chenille fabric helps save your floors from dripping water. Moisture is trapped in the bathroom mat's deep pile, allowing the rug to dry quickly and cleanly. [NON-SLIP BATH RUGS - PVC BOTTOM] Non-slip bottom is made of high quality PVC material. This anti-skid backing has practically slip resistance on the tile floor surface, that it won’t slip or slide to keep you more safe and cozy. Unlike other brands where the rubber backing tends to wear and peel off after a number of washes. The rugs are much stronger and durable for long lasting use. [Maintenance and Attention] Use only non-chlorine bleach when needed, hang to dry or air dry flat. Do not Bleach or Dry Clean. It is better to place the rugs in laundry bag when washing, shield and screen rugs from strong and direct sun exposure, not place the rugs on very hot floor or surface when drying. [Attention] : Place mat on CLEAN DRY SMOOTH FLOOR only. Water under mat can cause it to slip. Keep bottom of mat dry. Before using mat, test with foot to ensure it doesn't move.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91InSwCvoDS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SmartDeal","source_asin":"B08PVSQ6SR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-587524","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PVSQ6SR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PVSQ6SR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
