window.products.push({"id":587586,"name":"Swissmar Peeler Serrated Blade, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513fWOUyp2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This isn't just another peeler. Proprietary technology from Switzerland has given our Swiss Classic peelers a few new edges. The stainless steel blade is scalpel sharp-which means less effort to peel and a thinner peel with every stroke. The serrated blade peeler is perfect for more delicate fruits and vegetables such as kiwis, mangoes and tomatoes. A side cutter on each peeler removes eyes and blemishes from produce or can cut grooves in fruits and vegetables. Suitable for left and right handed use, dishwasher safe, Made in Switzerland.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/513fWOUyp2L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Swissmar","source_asin":"B004HYFL9A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-587586","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004HYFL9A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004HYFL9A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":587587,"name":"ECLIPSE Dreamer Star Laser Cut Room Darkening Grommet Window Curtains for Kids Bedroom or Nursery (2 Panels), 34 in x 84 in, Navy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.27,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZSN0hQzWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These Star Laser Cut curtains are a lovely, charming design that the kids will love just as much as you. The Star Laser Cut Room Darkening Window Curtain Pair will help keep out undwanted light, which will allow your toddler or young child to sleep longer. This feature also helps them to regulate the temperature and reduce noise coming in from outside. The subtle star design is suitable for any gender and is ideal for all ages.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZSN0hQzWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ECLIPSE","source_asin":"B09MF5JV74","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-587587","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MF5JV74","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MF5JV74","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":587588,"name":"C.R. Gibson Recipe Book, Durable 3-Ring Binder, Holds 40 Recipe Cards Measuring 4\" x 6\", Book Measures 9\" x 9.5\" − Savory Eats Chalkboard","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MTLS6rMBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Inspire organization with coordinating recipe cards, pocket organizers and recipe card file boxes in the Savory Eats collection. Recipe keeper and flip stand protects your pages as you cook while it stores and displays the instructions for your favorite dish. Helps to organize and store your most widely used recipes. Measuring approximately 9 x 9.5 x 1.75-Inch when closed, this organizer has durable 3-ring construction which allows you to place recipes into the correct category heading with the 12 included tabbed dividers as well as add to the book with more pages when needed (Refills available separately). Included are 20 PVC-free pocket pages, which hold two recipes per page and 40 coordinated recipe cards sized 4 x 6-Inch. Great gift for a wedding or a new graduate. 140 plus years young, C.R. Gibson was founded in 1870 in New York City by lithographer John Gibson. The focus then was on letterhead, stationery and marriage certificates. After beginning production of baby books in 1898, millions have been sold. 1 in every 4 babies today has a memory book made by C.R. Gibson. In the 1960s, the company expanded into the gift book and photo album market and now continues to progress through the digital technology age as the number one provider of products that celebrate life's most cherished moments. C.R. Gibson has since made artistic alliances and partnerships with some of the most unique and trusted brands to bring consumers a wide choice of not only high-quality paper products, but party and entertaining supplies with panache, along with kitchen, wedding and everyday gift items, all of which combine the most current trends, the best artists in the market and superior quality. Inspiring, fun and thoughtful products that you would be proud to give and excited to receive. That's just the first 140 years and so much more is still to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MTLS6rMBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"C.R. Gibson","source_asin":"B078FBVJ2K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-587588","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078FBVJ2K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078FBVJ2K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
