window.products.push({"id":587663,"name":"Milk Frother, Electric Milk Steamer 4-in-1 Automatic Hot/Cold Foam Maker and Milk Warmer with Two Whisks, Easy Cleaning, Silent Operation for Latte, C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cPI6KNH-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤️【4 in1 Superior Multifunction】The Electric coffee frother and steamer produce rich and creamy hot dense foam, hot airy foam, hot milk, and cold milk froth, use whole milk (Fat content>3%) is recommended. The milk frother and steamer is the best ideal for cappuccino, macchiato, latte, hot chocolate, and iced coffee, A good day starts with a cappuccino or latte. ❤️【250ML Large Capacity & Clearly Indicators】The milk frother with clearly MAX(250ml,120ml) & MIN (70ml) indicators levels for the volume of milk or chocolate inside, Can heat up to 250ml/8.5oz milk for a latte or chocolate milk, or froth up to 120 ml/4 oz foam for cappuccino or macchiato at a time. The foaming ratio is 96%, 88% for cold milk froth. ⚠️⚠️⚠️Frothing milk should not exceed 120ml/4 oz, otherwise it may overflow, and The base is not washable. ❤️【Simple Operation With One Button】After the electric frother is connected to the base, select the required working mode through the button, Press once to select cappuccino mode (dense foam), Press twice to select latte mode (fluffy foam), Press three times to select heating milk, Press four times to select only frothing, The milk steamer starts to work after staying for 3s. The temperature of milk froth or heated milk is about 65 ± 5 ℃/149 ± 41°F, and the working time is 90-120 seconds. ❤️【Easy Cleaning & Quiet】This powerful 450W automatic milk frother and new advanced technology is noiseless when it works. The Hot & cold froth milk steamer is made of adopts rubber, food grade pp material , and 304 stainless steel non-stick coating on the inner surface, stylish and durable, The cold foam milk frother is recommended to clean the inside with soapy water and a soft brush after use, suitable for using in your kitchen or office. ❤️【Safe Durable & Service】The milk steamer frother passed UL certificates:E162604 and FDA, and provides a base with suction cups (3pcs) to ensure that the does not move during use, and a replaceable whisks. Covered by a 24-month warranty, please feel free to contact us if you have any request, we will solve your problem within 24 hours. it is also the best gift for friends, family, and partners.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cPI6KNH-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lengneoi","source_asin":"B09PNLRM2Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-587663","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PNLRM2Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PNLRM2Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
