window.products.push({"id":587766,"name":"Bonavita BV2100SC Auto Tare Gram Scale, Glass","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zf2gXCMvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For a precise pour-over, you need a scale that can think for you! The Bonavita Auto Tare Gram Scale offers precise measurements with automatic taring, for a consistent cup of coffee or pot of tea every time. Whether you're brewing a fresh cup of coffee or weighing ingredients for that perfect cake, the Bonavita Auto Tare Gram Scale let's you choose how to use it. Pick from four auto tare or two manual modes while precisely weighing down to a tenth of a gram. Start the count-up timer to know exactly when you're done, or skip the timer and play it by ear! The sleek design is not only appealing to the eye, but also features unique nano-coating protection to help prevent water damage. Cordless and battery operated, this scale includes a removable cover for when it's time to take your coffee bar or portable kitchen on the road. Program the Auto Tare Gram Scale to turn off automatically after 60, 120 or 180 seconds of inactivity, saving you energy and a few extra batteries. However, the auto-off mode can be manually disabled if an extended amount of inactivity is preferred.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zf2gXCMvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bonavita","source_asin":"B01AJJ1Q6I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-587766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AJJ1Q6I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AJJ1Q6I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":587767,"name":"IYEE NATURE Electric Standing Desk with Oak Top 48 x 24 Inches, Stand Up Desk with Adjustable Height and Splice Board for Home Office","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vtVPrkmpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"{Electric standing desk} The original intention of the standing desk is to solve the problems of sedentary backache and reduce the pressure on the spine. Sedentary office is very harmful, not only the accumulation of fat in the waist and abdomen, the dull thinking, but also the back pain. Advocating alternate sitting and standing can keep the body in the best working condition, be able to concentrate on work, and improve work efficiency. {Height adjustment function} -The stand up desk has 3 preset buttons, and the lifting range is 28.75\" to 45.25\". It is easy to adjust the most comfortable height of the sit stand desk with one button. Suitable for all men, women and children! The lifting process is not only no noise but also fast and good operation. Let you have a smart and healthy office life! {Powerful load-bearing function}-standing desk adjustable height adopts a lifting system of solid steel. The sit to stand desk includes an industrial-grade steel frame that can support up to 220 pounds. Computers, books, head phones, desk lamps, speakers, etc. can be easily carried. The desktop is stable and does not shake,and will not shake when typing. {Anti-collision function}-The standing desk detects obstacles on the desk path through sensors, and when it encounters resistance during the lifting process, it will retreat in the opposite direction, so there is no need to worry about things under the desk being crushed. The lifting is stable and smooth without jamming and is safer. {Quality Assurance}: The uplift desk is made of solid desktop,which which has strong bearing capacity. adjustable standing desk built-in cable management groove to solve the trouble of cable chaos! No need to worry about installation, the instructions are simple and easy to understand, and easy to assemble! If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, we are always happy to solve the problem for you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vtVPrkmpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IYEE NATURE","source_asin":"B095RYPGCR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-587767","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095RYPGCR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095RYPGCR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
