window.products.push({"id":587807,"name":"O-heart Tree of Life Dream Catcher Wall Decor, White Dreamcatcher, Feather Wall Hanging, Home Decor for Kids Nursery Bedroom Boho Room Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bVfl8ducL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Once upon a time, a young girl had a dream. In the dream, a spider taught her how to weave a net and told her the web can make people catch good dreams and strengthen the communication between people and the spiritual world.  The girl woke up and followed the enlightenment of the dream, then she made a dream catcher and hung it in front of the bed. The next morning, she woke up to find beautiful beads hanging on the net. When she touched the beads, the god spoke to her, \"Beads are the power and wisdom captured by the dream catcher when you are asleep. The nightmare has been caught by the net and disappeared with the rising sun. Now bring it to your people around you.\" So the dream catcher was passed down like this. 💬This is a white dream catcher for room decro. The small dream catcher is also suitable for kids gift, as a boho kids room decro.If you do not like the topic of white, there are also other handmade dream catchers in our store with all kinds of sizes and colors. Nice Dream Dream Catchers for Wall Hanging Home Decor Perfect hanging ornaments for your home decorative, especially like bedroom, living room, house, windows, office, balcony, wall art, etc. Specification: HIGH QUALITY -- Made of metal circle, beads, high quality yarn and alloy chain, carefully selected feather. We weave with natural materials processed into exquisite handcrafts. PROPER SIZE -- Diameter of the circle is 7.8 inches, total Length is approximately 20 inches. UNIQUE MATCH -- With the white feather, it looks wonderful at night, brings warm and love to your family and catch the sweet dreams and let you enjoy the sleep. Perfect room decor and meaningful gifts for who you really care. Package included: 1 x dream catcher. Notes: Due to the light and screen difference, the item's color may be slightly different from the pictures, please allow 1/4\" differences due to manual measurement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bVfl8ducL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"O-heart","source_asin":"B08ZMYG3BS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-587807","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZMYG3BS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZMYG3BS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
