window.products.push({"id":587966,"name":"Fathers Day Mug From Daughter - Large 15oz Coffee Mug for Best Dad Ever. Gratitude for Daddy. Fathers Day Gift From Wife, Son. Gift For Husband. Birth","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tYSzO4IoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍉 Trips to work with him. Projects you would share. Endless games of basketball, baseball, playing catch with the football. Vacations, trips to the beach, to visit relatives in distant states.Road trips that you cherish still today.🍉 Your super cool Dad was by no means perfect … just like the rest of us.And he loved being a Dad … being your Dad. And he gave you his best.Even when it wasn’t enough … And now you know, and are moregrateful for him than ever. 🍉 You’ll find a few of our other mugs on Amazon, and we have more in the works.We design and print our mugs in Edmonds WA, and the mugs are made in China by good folks who work hard. 🍉 We all need to be lifted up in this crazy, beautiful world. And a simple gift of a coffee mug, with words which bring a warm smile,reminds that person that he or she is important to you, special, beautiful.Sometimes it’s in the smallest of ways that we make the world a better place. 🍉 ‘Surround yourself with people who lift you higher.’ That's one of our favorite quotes. Let’s be the ones who lift others higher!🍉 You're more important to us than the money. If you're unhappy with your mug at any time, for any reason, just let us know.1. We'll replace it, or 2. send you one of our other mugs, or 3. refund your money. 🍉 Thank you for considering our mugs! You are awesome to us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tYSzO4IoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WATERMELON HEADS","source_asin":"B09KG3QZ9W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-587966","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KG3QZ9W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KG3QZ9W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
